1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,315
Alternate junctions are blackened and face the front, at the narrow end of a polished cone.

2
00:00:06,315 --> 00:00:10,559
The other junctions are shielded inside, at room temperature.

3
00:00:10,559 --> 00:00:20,494
Radiation falling into the cone heats the black junctions, and the many small e m fs add up to drive a current through a sensitive galvanometer.

